{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-09",
  "title": "骨の髄まで",
  "storyCode": "4-9",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c542e34464ee00f6de5d755887bf19c31025434fd3fa9cfb144eb32bb24a1958",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "フロストリーフ、そんなに突出しないで！　危ないでしょう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "無茶は承知の上だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "うわあああっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "れ、冷気で盾を裂かれた……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "そんなこと、あるのか……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "邪魔だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "アーミヤ！　フロストリーフが敵陣に突っ込んで、あの指揮官のほうへ向かってるわ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！　狙撃オペレーターと術師オペレーターで、フロストリーフさんの援護をお願いします！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "おやおや？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "どうして僕のところへ来たのかな？　子ギツネさん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "貴様に罪を贖わせ、苦痛の涙を流させて――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "――命を奪ってやるためだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "退いてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "うわあっ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "な、なんだこの黒いアーツ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "っ、撤退だ！　走れ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "メフィストの手下みたいにはなりたかねーからな……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "もう逃げ場はありませんよ、メフィスト！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "おっと。今の人員じゃ、ロドスの相手にはならないか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あなたの残酷な行いを、悔い改めてもらいます！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "さあ、観念しろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "子ギツネさん、少し近すぎやしないかい？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "この手で貴様を殺すためだからな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "命を冒涜する者に――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "生きる価値などない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ふうん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "まあ、好きなように言えばいいさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "なっ、脚が……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "アーミヤ！　そこら中からレユニオンが……！　数こそ多くはないけれど、これは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "……っ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "あれは……スノーデビル小隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "あの人たちまでお出ましとはね……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "さて、君たちに新しいお友達を紹介してあげよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "この舞台での真の主役をどうか拍手で迎えておくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "西北凍原の悪夢と呼ばれた、スノーデビルのお姫様――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "フロストノヴァだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "彼女にかかれば、君たちの血も肉もすべてが凍り付いて――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "少しずつ、少しずつ、削り取られていくことになる。まあ、大いに楽しんでくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……っ！　ダメ……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "――――――メフィスト。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "まずは、獣よりよほど残酷な殺人鬼であるお前から、雪原に放り出して殺すべきだと思うがな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "へえ、言ってくれるじゃないか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "だけど、今回の敵はロドスでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "フロストリーフさん――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#9",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "下がってください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "アーミヤ、皆を連れて逃げろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "できません！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あんな人が相手では……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "そうだな。……奴に追いつかれてしまったら――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "私たちに勝ち目はない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "……ふっ。……まだ、十分に生きたとは言えないが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "お前たちに出会えて、私は幸せだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "――行け。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "フロストリーフさん！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "いいから走れ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "――――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "案ずるな、ロドスの者たちよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "お前たちのことは、苦しまないよう死なせてやろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
